{"id":"0272d8602e3436b1","group":"88","path":"88/88-df-tm-transition.md","title":"Turing Machine Transition","display":"df-tm-transition — Turing Machine Transition","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-df-tm-transition","aliases":["88-df-tm-transition"],"display":"df-tm-transition — Turing Machine Transition","depends_on":[]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-df-tm-transition"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-df-tm-transition</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-tm-transition — Turing Machine Transition"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q,\\Gamma\">\\(Q,\\Gamma\\)</span> (state-code set and tape-symbol-code set)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q_{\\mathrm{accept}},q_{\\mathrm{reject}}\\in Q\">\\(q_{\\mathrm{accept}},q_{\\mathrm{reject}}\\in Q\\)</span> (halting states)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta\">\\(\\delta\\)</span> (deterministic transition map)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Transition}(\\delta,Q,\\Gamma,q_{\\mathrm{accept}},q_{\\mathrm{reject}})\">\\(\\mathrm{Transition}(\\delta,Q,\\Gamma,q_{\\mathrm{accept}},q_{\\mathrm{reject}})\\)</span> (transition-map predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tm\\text{-}transition}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Transition}(\\delta,Q,\\Gamma,q_{\\mathrm{accept}},q_{\\mathrm{reject}})\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nQ,\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathbb N\n\\land q_{\\mathrm{accept}},q_{\\mathrm{reject}}\\in Q\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land q_{\\mathrm{accept}}\\neq q_{\\mathrm{reject}}\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\delta:\n\\bigl(Q\\setminus\\{q_{\\mathrm{accept}},q_{\\mathrm{reject}}\\}\\bigr)\n\\times\\Gamma\\to Q\\times\\Gamma\\times\\{L,R\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tm\\text{-}transition}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Transition}(\\delta,Q,\\Gamma,q_{\\mathrm{accept}},q_{\\mathrm{reject}})\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nQ,\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathbb N\n\\land q_{\\mathrm{accept}},q_{\\mathrm{reject}}\\in Q\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land q_{\\mathrm{accept}}\\neq q_{\\mathrm{reject}}\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\delta:\n\\bigl(Q\\setminus\\{q_{\\mathrm{accept}},q_{\\mathrm{reject}}\\}\\bigr)\n\\times\\Gamma\\to Q\\times\\Gamma\\times\\{L,R\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta\">\\(\\delta\\)</span>是状态转换函数</li>\n<li>开始状态属于转移函数定义域；只有接受和拒绝状态没有后继步</li>\n<li>每次转换改变状态、符号和位置</li>\n<li>箭头表示总函数，所以每个非停机状态—读入符号对恰有一个后继动作；\n这是确定型、仅以接受/拒绝为停机状态的约定。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"Q,\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"q_{\\mathrm{accept}},q_{\\mathrm{reject}}\\in Q","display":false},{"tex":"\\delta","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Transition}(\\delta,Q,\\Gamma,q_{\\mathrm{accept}},q_{\\mathrm{reject}})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tm\\text{-}transition}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Transition}(\\delta,Q,\\Gamma,q_{\\mathrm{accept}},q_{\\mathrm{reject}})\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\nQ,\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathbb N\n\\land q_{\\mathrm{accept}},q_{\\mathrm{reject}}\\in Q\\\\\n&{}\\land q_{\\mathrm{accept}}\\neq q_{\\mathrm{reject}}\\\\\n&{}\\land\\delta:\n\\bigl(Q\\setminus\\{q_{\\mathrm{accept}},q_{\\mathrm{reject}}\\}\\bigr)\n\\times\\Gamma\\to Q\\times\\Gamma\\times\\{L,R\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\delta","display":false}],"bytes":1348,"backlinks":[{"id":"c9d922648d98305d","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Transition}(\\delta,Q,\\Gamma,q_{\\mathrm{accept}},q_{\\mathrm{reject}})$ (transition map, see [[88-df-tm-transition]])"},{"id":"c5514506c707c9ae","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{TM}$ 及其八个坐标投影见 [[88-df-turing-machine]]；$L,R$ 是 [[88-df-tm-transition]] 的两个方向符号，不是本文件的集合或规则参数。"},{"id":"27b8db839bec5892","anchor":"ref-156","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[88-df-acceptable-program-numbering.md]]\n[[88-df-ackermann-function.md]]\n[[88-df-alphabet.md]]\n[[88-df-arithmetical-formula.md]]\n[[88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy.md]]\n[[88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy-delta.md]]\n[[88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy-full.md]]\n[[88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy-pi.md]]\n[[88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy-sigma.md]]\n[[88-df-assignment.md]]\n[[88-df-atomic-formula.md]]\n[[88-df-axiom.md]]\n[[88-df-bijective.md]]\n[[88-df-bound-variable.md]]\n[[88-df-bounded-quantifier.md]]\n[[88-df-canonical-model.md]]\n[[88-df-cardinality.md]]\n[[88-df-ce-indexing.md]]\n[[88-df-ce-set.md]]\n[[88-df-church-turing-thesis.md]]\n[[88-df-classical-calculus.md]]\n[[88-df-closed-term.md]]\n[[88-df-compactness.md]]\n[[88-df-completeness.md]]\n[[88-df-computable-function.md]]\n[[88-df-consistent.md]]\n[[88-df-countable.md]]\n[[88-df-creative-set.md]]\n[[88-df-decidable-set.md]]\n[[88-df-defined.md]]\n[[88-df-delta0-formula.md]]\n[[88-df-delta1-set.md]]\n[[88-df-derivation.md]]\n[[88-df-diagonal-lemma.md]]\n[[88-df-effective-join.md]]\n[[88-df-effective-program-numbering.md]]\n[[88-df-elementary-equivalence.md]]\n[[88-df-elementary-substructure.md]]\n[[88-df-encoding.md]]\n[[88-df-finite-extension.md]]\n[[88-df-first-incompleteness.md]]\n[[88-df-formula.md]]\n[[88-df-free-variable.md]]\n[[88-df-function.md]]\n[[88-df-function-rec